    ["How many pills does someone need?","Just one."],
    ["Any competitors?","No other pill. But hair transplants and treatments compete on price."],
    ["What do alternatives cost?","A hair transplant costs about $5,000 on average."],
    ["What did development cost?","We'll come back to that."],
    ["Can they make enough pills?","Yes, capacity isn't a constraint."]
